  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>if Rishi is a judge and he is not arrogant, then he is honest can be written as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p>Now, Negation of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;{Using De-Morgan&#39;s law}</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
